<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Key Philosophical Princi=
ples:</strong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Respect Over Convenienc=
e</strong>: Lazy loading represents respect cho user's time, device capabil=
ities, v=C3=A0 network constraints over developer convenience.</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Intentionality Over Abu=
ndance</strong>: Load only what's needed, when it's needed. Fight against t=
he temptation of "just in case" loading.</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Progressive Enhancement=
</strong>: Build from minimal viable experience upward, not from maximum fe=
atures downward.</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Failure as Design Input=
</strong>: Design for failure scenarios, not just happy paths. Networks fai=
l, devices struggle, users abandon.</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Business Value Through =
Technical Excellence</strong>: Performance optimization isn't just engineer=
ing pride=E2=80=94it's business imperative that directly impacts revenue, r=
etention, v=C3=A0 user satisfaction.</li>
</ol>
